<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάππας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>papa</i>, child's word for <i>father</i>; mostly in voc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάππᾰ φίλε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.57
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαῖρε π. φίλτατε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philem.
					42
				</span></i>
			: in acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάππαν</span>
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					120
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				645
			</span></i>:—nom. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάπας</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGiss.</u>
				80.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; acc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάπαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BMus.Inscr.</u>
					918
				</span></i>
			 (Halic.); dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάπᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					176p.49V.
				</span></i>
			 (Syracusan, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				565.17
			</span></i>, but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶς</span></b>  (which
			should prob. be <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶ</span></b> , for <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> adds <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ καὶ μᾶ
			μήτηρ</span>) is Syrac. acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				651.7
			</span></i>).</div>
